BOSS Colossus Splitting Boulder
    Events
        Time - Every (Random real number between 10.00 and 20.00) seconds of game time
    Conditions
        BossColossusSlam Equal to False
        BossColossusGolems Equal to False
        BossColossusBoulders Equal to False
    Actions
        -------- Get BossColossus location and facing angle --------
        Set VariableSet BossColossusTempPoint = (Position of BossColossus)
        Set VariableSet BossColossusFacingAngle = (Facing of BossColossus)
        -------- Calculate the location 300 units in front of BossColossus --------
        Set VariableSet BossColossusSplitBoulderLoc = (BossColossusTempPoint offset by 300.00 towards BossColossusFacingAngle degrees.)
        -------- Order BossColossus to cast the ability at the new location --------
        Unit - Order BossColossus to Neutral Brewmaster - Breath Of Fire BossColossusSplitBoulderLoc
        -------- Clean up memory leaks --------
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossusTempPoint)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossColossusSplitBoulderLoc)
        Sound - Play Colossus04 <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to BossColossus
